<title>UK: NWE jet fuel prices ease with futures.</title>
<headline>NWE jet fuel prices ease with futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel oil prices eased on Friday in line with benchmark IPE gas oil futures in thin trade, traders said.</p>
<p>July IPE gas oil futures settled $1.0 lower at $158.50 a tonne, some $4.0 below last Friday's close.</p>
<p>Barge premiums stagnated at around July IPE +$15/+$16 fob ARA.</p>
<p>&quot;It's remarkably quiet,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Some traders said that an industry function in Italy had absented many key players from the market. -- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714.</p>
